{
  "ID": "46041",
  "post_title": "El balón echa a rodar en el VIII Torneo de la Cerámica de fútbol base en Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-04-18 13:45:14",
  "post_name": "el-balon-echa-a-rodar-en-el-viii-torneo-de-la-ceramica-de-futbol-base-en-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>A las 9 en punto de la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes el bal&oacute;n ha echado a rodar en los campos municipales de La Cossa y l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic, en Onda, donde hasta la tarde de este s&aacute;bado se disputar&aacute;n los 112 partidos del <a href=\"http://www.escolafutbolonda.com/\" target=\"_blank\">VIII Torneo de la Cer&aacute;mica de f&uacute;tbol base</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_2626.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Seis de esos encuentros se celebrar&aacute;n la ma&ntilde;ana del s&aacute;bado en el campo municipal de La Serratella.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_2692.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Mientras tanto, se ultiman los preparativos para la Pascua Taurina, en el Recinto Multiusos, y para la Pascua Sonora, en dos carpas instaladas en el aparcamiento exterior.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_2696.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El s&aacute;bado por la tarde coincidir&aacute;n los tres eventos en la zona deportiva.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2519.jpg\" alt=\"img_2519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2520.jpg\" alt=\"img_2520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2521.jpg\" alt=\"img_2521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2523.jpg\" alt=\"img_2523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2524.jpg\" alt=\"img_2524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2525.jpg\" alt=\"img_2525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2526.jpg\" alt=\"img_2526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2527.jpg\" alt=\"img_2527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2528.jpg\" alt=\"img_2528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2529.jpg\" alt=\"img_2529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2530.jpg\" alt=\"img_2530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2531.jpg\" alt=\"img_2531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2532.jpg\" alt=\"img_2532\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2533.jpg\" alt=\"img_2533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2535.jpg\" alt=\"img_2535\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iniciviiitorneigceramicafutbolbase/img_2536.jpg\" alt=\"img_2536\" styl